 "statement": "The morphism $\\mathsf{SepBl}_U(Z_1,Z_2)\\to X$ is $U$-admissible, and the\nstrict transforms of $Z_1$ and $Z_2$ in it are disjoint.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-lem-nagata-sketch-boundary/lemma-nagata-separate-closed-subschemes.md",
